# Local-only secrets for `npm run dev` (Cloudflare Pages Functions auto-load .dev.vars).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in your key. `.dev.vars` is gitignored.

# Google Gemini API key — enables "Scan with AI" in the Pantry.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# Optional: override the vision/document model (default: gemini-flash-latest).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest

# OpenRouter API key — powers "Ask Life OS" (/api/chat). Get one at
# https://openrouter.ai/keys. The key must be able to reach tool-calling models.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model chain used by Ask Life OS. Accepts a single slug
# or a comma-separated fallback list; the first model that accepts the request
# wins. Every model MUST support tool calling. Defaults to a free-tier chain.
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free,inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash:free
